content.text:
The incident has one root cause: ts-admin-basic-info-service, with its `getAllContacts` method slowed inside the process. Its effect reaches the user through ts-ui-dashboard, the entry service. I did not find a second fault that reached users, so I'm reporting one.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-admin-basic-info-service",
      "fault_kind": "application_method_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.95) p95_ms, min(duration/1e6) mn, max(duration/1e6) mx FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name='AdminBasicInfoController.getAllContacts' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "getAllContacts takes about 1,716–1,719 ms on all 27 abnormal calls, versus 5–9 ms normally."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT c.service_name, c.span_name, c.attr_span_kind, count(*) n, approx_quantile(c.duration/1e6,0.95) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id WHERE p.span_name='AdminBasicInfoController.getAllContacts' GROUP BY 1,2,3 ORDER BY n DESC",
          "claim": "The only child of getAllContacts is a 6 ms client GET, so the extra ~1.7 s is spent inside the method itself."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.95) p95_ms, avg(CASE WHEN attr_status_code='Error' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) err FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-admin-basic-info-service' AND span_name LIKE 'GET /api/v1/adminbasicservice%' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Only the /contacts endpoint is slow (about 1,721 ms p95); the configs, prices, stations and trains endpoints stay at 5–9 ms with no errors."
        },
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT metric, avg(value) v FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-admin-basic-info-service' AND metric IN ('k8s.pod.cpu_limit_utilization','k8s.pod.memory_limit_utilization','container.cpu.usage') GROUP BY 1",
          "claim": "Pod CPU and memory utilisation stay low (CPU limit utilisation about 0.3%, memory about 15%), so this is not resource saturation."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-admin-basic-info-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.95) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND span_name='GET /api/v1/adminbasicservice/adminbasic/contacts' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "ts-ui-dashboard's contacts requests inherit the ~1,722 ms latency from ts-admin-basic-info-service, with no errors."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

